### Get LGAs for a specific state by state code
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/states/LA/lgas
Content-Type: application/json

### Get LGAs for another state (example: Kano)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/states/KN/lgas
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all address categories
GET http://localhost:3000/api/address/categories
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a new address (example)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "label": "Home",
  "state": "LA",
  "lga": "ETI-OSA",
  "city": "Lekki",
  "street": "Admiralty Way",
  "houseNumber": "123",
  "landmark": "Near Lekki Mall",
  "latitude": 6.4281,
  "longitude": 3.4219,
  "apartment": "Flat 4B",
  "estate": "Lekki Phase 1",
  "specialDescription": "Blue gate, white fence",
  "category": "home",
  "noStreetAddress": false
}

### Get user's saved addresses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

